WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.400 line:8% align:center
This step is called the basic step.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.200 line:8% align:center
We dance it on two.

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.200 line:8% align:center
Start with your left foot.

4
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:13.000 line:8% align:center
Break on two, transfer the weight
completely, and come back on six.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.200 line:8% align:center
The most important detail is the weight
transfer.

6
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.200 line:8% align:center
Do not rush it, and keep the supporting
knee soft.

7
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.080 line:8% align:center
Let us do it slowly with the counts.

8
00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:27.680 line:8% align:center
Five, six, seven, eight.

9
00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:32.480 line:8% align:center
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven,
eight.

10
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:33.780 line:8% align:center
One more time.

11
00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:38.880 line:8% align:center
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven,
eight.

12
00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:43.130 line:8% align:center
Now with the music. Here we go.
